phere:**\nAbove her head, there is a glowing, circular halo or aura. It is not a traditional golden halo, but rather a jagged, broken ring of fiery orange light, resembling a crown of thorns or a fractured circle of energy. This halo reinforces her otherworldly or divine nature.\n\nThe overall atmosphere is one of epic grandeur and desolation. The contrast between the bright, divine light from the windows and the dark, fiery armor of the warrior creates a powerful visual tension. The image evokes themes of destruction, resilience, divine power, and the aftermath of a cataclysmic event.\n\n**Technical Details:**\nThe image is marked with \"AI生成\" (AI-generated) in the top left corner and \"即梦AI\" (Ji Meng AI) in the bottom right, indicating it was created using AI image generation technology. The lighting, textures, and composition are highly polished and cinematic, typical of advanced AI art."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 14, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [16], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [545.5555419921875, 2172.4443359375], "widgets_values": ["afea3c79d022cd9a306b484126826f2879e8aef70e7cc57fbb3bf5d57a3a0dca.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": 